{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a JRPG inspired game where you explore an destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combat is a classic turn based system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes. Each enemy has elemental strengths and weaknesses that can be exploited to stop time and unleash powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between fights there you can explore a variety of environments such as a dense fog forrest and a clock tower. During exploration you can find many things to help you in combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The games visuals are 2.5d where both pixel art, 3d models, and voxel models are used to create a variety of environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3571630?t=1741372382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/52d318eed7f10339928328ab44dcaa446b7db596/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741372382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/0d05fbae71b126f2313427aeb0c2e29f6937ed1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741372382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3571630/0d05fbae71b126f2313427aeb0c2e29f6937ed1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741372382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is a JRPG inspired game where you explore an destroy a variety of powerful foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The combat is a classic turn based system where you are given a wide range of options to take down your foes. Each enemy has elementa